    <etd:contextText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Automation bias - how to avoid a situation in which recruiters over-rely on the outputs of such systems? How do we ensure that their autonomy to make decisions is not affected? &#13;
&#13;
For example the Assessment List for Trustworthy AI asks "Could the AI system affect human autonomy by generating over-reliance by end-users?" ? &#13;
&#13;
How do we make sure that the decision made by the system are understandable and explainable to the applicants and recruiters?</etd:contextText>
  </rdf:Description>
