    <etd:contextText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">**Domain**: Insurance/Risk Assessment  &#13;
**Description**: AI-powered insurance underwriting systems show bias in risk assessment and pricing, particularly affecting minority communities and certain geographic areas.&#13;
&#13;
**Ethical Challenges**:&#13;
&#13;
* **Proxy Discrimination**: Use of zip codes and other proxies that correlate with protected characteristics  &#13;
* **Historical Data Bias**: Training on historical data that reflects past discriminatory practices  &#13;
* **Disparate Impact**: Higher premiums for equivalent risk profiles in minority communities  &#13;
* **Regulatory Compliance**: Violation of fair lending and anti-discrimination laws&#13;
&#13;
**Public Datasets**:&#13;
&#13;
* **Communities and Crime Dataset**: UCI repository with socioeconomic and crime data  &#13;
* **URL**: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/183/communities+and+crime  &#13;
* **German Credit Dataset**: Classic fairness benchmark for credit risk assessment  &#13;
* **URL**: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/144/statlog+german+credit+data  &#13;
* **Default of Credit Card Clients**: Taiwan dataset for credit default prediction  &#13;
* **URL**: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/350/default+of+credit+card+clients</etd:contextText>
    <etd:hasSourceEntity rdf:resource="https://alfie-project.eu/etd-hub/entity/person/expert-4-c84647f9"/>
